# Interview transcripts land here.
#
# File name format: YYYY-MM-DD-<github_username>.md
# (e.g., 2026-04-29-jane-dev.md)
#
# Source the file's content from `docs/interviews/template.md` —
# copy that on the morning of the call, fill the metadata block,
# take notes inline during the interview, and clean up against the
# Otter.ai recording within the hour.
#
# These transcripts may contain PII (names, employer hints, candid
# product feedback). Treat them as private — do not paste into a
# slide deck or share without explicit consent.
